### Third-Party & Demonstration Materials Disclaimer

1. **Source Code & Architecture:**
   The MIT License above applies to all source code, architecture, agentic orchestration,
   machine learning pipelines, explainability modules, user interfaces, and documentation
   authored in this repository.

2. **Demonstration Policy Documents (`rag/documents/`):**
   The policy PDF files contained in `rag/documents/` are synthetic demonstration underwriting
   policies designed solely for academic research evaluation, testing Retrieval-Augmented
   Generation (RAG), and prototyping decision-support interfaces. They do not constitute
   official banking documents, real legal underwriting commitments, or proprietary banking materials.

3. **Research & Synthetic Datasets (`data/`):**
   The datasets in `data/` are compiled from academic questionnaire surveys and synthetic
   generative augmentations for statistical evaluation purposes.
